, "", "If sin A = 3/5 and cos B = 5/13 (A, B acute), cos(A − B) is", "56/65", "63/65", "33/65", "16/65", "cos A = 4/5, sin B = 12/13. cos(A − B) = cos A cos B + sin A sin B = 20/65 + 36/65 = 56/65."], ["Mathematics", "", "The amplitude and period of y = 3 sin 2x are", "3 and 180°", "3 and 360°", "6 and 180°", "3 and 90°", "Period = 360°/2 = 180°."], ["Mathematics", "", "Evaluate lim (x → 2) (x² − 4)/(x − 2).", "4", "0", "2", "undefined", "Factor: x + 2 → 4."], ["Mathematics", "", "The derivative of y = ln(3x² + 1) is", "6x/(3x² + 1)", "1/(3x² + 1)", "6x", "3x/(3x² + 1)", "Chain rule."], ["Mathematics", "", "The point of inflexion of y = x³ − 3x² occurs at x =", "1", "0", "2", "3", "y'' = 6x − 6 = 0 → x = 1."], ["Mathematics", "", "The equation of the normal to y = x² at (1, 1) is", "x + 2y = 3", "2x + y = 3", "y = 2x − 1", "x − 2y = −1", "Tangent slope 2, normal slope −½: y − 1 = −½(x − 1)."], ["Mathematics", "", "The volume of the solid formed by rotating y = x from x = 0 to x = 3 about the x-axis is", "9π", "27π", "3π", "π", "∫π x² dx = π × 27/3 = 9π."], ["Mathematics", "", "∫₀^(π/2) cos x dx equals", "1", "0", "−1", "π/2", "[sin x] = 1."], ["Mathematics", "", "The area between y = x² and y = 2x is", "4/3", "2", "8/3", "1", "∫₀² (2x − x²) dx = 4 − 8/3 = 4/3."], ["Mathematics", "", "A cuboid with edges 3, 4 and 12 has a space diagonal of", "13", "15", "12", "19", "√(9 + 16 + 144) = √169 = 13."], ["Mathematics", "", "A cone and a cylinder have the same radius and height. The ratio of volumes (cone : cylinder) is", "1 : 3", "1 : 2", "2 : 3", "1 : 1", "⅓πr²h : πr²h."], ["Mathematics", "", "The curved surface area of a sphere of radius 7 cm is (π = 22/7)", "616 cm²", "154 cm²", "1 437 cm³", "308 cm²", "4πr² = 4 × 22/7 × 49 = 616 cm²."], ["Mathematics", "", "The mean of the numbers x, x + 2, x + 4 is 10. Find x.", "8", "6", "10", "12", "3x + 6 = 30 → x = 8."], ["Mathematics", "", "A bag has 3 red and 2 blue marbles. Two are drawn with replacement. The probability of two